635	    /**
636	     Cleans an inline {@code style} attribute value declaration by declaration. Declarations that are malformed, or
637	     * that reference an external resource ({@code url(...)}, {@code @import}, or the legacy {@code expression(...)}
638	     * function) whose URL fails the protocol rules configured for the tag's style attribute, are removed individually;
639	     * the surviving declarations keep their original order and text. Does not throw on malformed CSS.
640	
641	     @param tagName the tag the attribute is on; selects the applicable protocol configuration
642	     @param el the element the attribute is on, to resolve URLs against its base URI
643	     @param value the source style attribute value
644	     @return the cleaned value, or {@code null} if no declaration survives (in which case the attribute is removed)
645	     */
