1014	     Check if a URL attribute should be normalized to an absolute URL in the cleaned output. Uses the configured
1015	     protocols for that tag+attribute pair, falling back to {@code :all} only if the tag does not define the
1016	     attribute.
1017	     */
1018	    boolean shouldAbsUrl(String tagName, String attrKey) {
1019	        if (preserveRelativeLinks) return false;
